/P 45 0 R
/E (Three machine learning models are selected: Logistic Regression, Random Forest, and Gradient Boosting. In particular, hyperparameter tuning is conducted using the validation set extracted from the training set to avoid data leakage. Moreover, to mitigate class imbalance, class weights are used to give more importance to the under-represented class. Once the optimal configurations are identified, models are retrained on the full training set and evaluated on the test set. )
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [18]
>>
